OL,3,GNEWSAHow 'crumbling' St Mary's could
OL,4,Alook when rebuilt
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetailed plans for a new St Mary's
OL,7,FHospital have been released by the NHS.
OL,9,FParts of the hospital in Paddington,
OL,10,Fwest London, date back to 1845.
OL,11,FImperial College Healthcare NHS Trust,
OL,12,Fwhich manages the hospital, previously
OL,13,Fdescribed some buildings as
OL,14,F"crumbling".
OL,16,FPrevious plans have been released for
OL,17,Fthe new building, but this latest
OL,18,Fpublication reveals much more of the
OL,19,Fdetail of what will be included.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
