OL,3,GNEWSAHow 'crumbling' St Mary's could
OL,4,Alook when rebuilt
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Julian Redhead, chief executive of
OL,7,FImperial College Healthcare NHS Trust,
OL,8,Fsaid the current site was "very old and
OL,9,Fincreasingly difficult to maintain",
OL,10,Fwith "millions spent every year on
OL,11,Fessential maintenance".
